        {
          "id": 503447807,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi,\nI think we have had this discussion before. NGAP and S1AP also come to mind. I think that we should consider which way we prefere and make that the default. Lately I have been annoyed having to dig down trough the tree to find the nas part which was what I wanted to look at. So not sure which metod to chose and I could see that the behaviour suggested here could be the default one and the traditionalists would have to set the preference :-)\nRegards \nAnders",
          "author": {
            "id": 6792385,
            "username": "AndersBroman",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "AndersBroman",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/132fb48f26018ea9516aea909144af3c3a94eaf2ba477efaa9a232abe80d322c?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/AndersBroman"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-02-07T16:18:24.409Z",
