        {
          "id": 503450253,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "For NGAP/S1AP this is a no go for me as you want to easily link the NAS PDU with the bearer description and you can have more than one in a single message.\nFor this use case I understand the rationale, thus I'm not against it. But I would really prefer if the default behavior was the backward compatible one.",
